<!-- wp:divi/text {"module":{"meta":{"adminLabel":{"desktop":{"value":"Title"}}},"advanced":{"text":{"text":{"desktop":{"value":{"orientation":"center"}}}}},"decoration":{"sizing":{"desktop":{"value":{"maxWidth":"700px","alignment":"center"}}}}},"content":{"decoration":{"bodyFont":{"body":{"font":{"desktop":{"value":{"family":"Montserrat","weight":"500","capitalization":"uppercase","color":"#de7e0a","size":"14px","letterSpacing":"1.5px"}}}}},"headingFont":{"h2":{"font":{"desktop":{"value":{"family":"Montserrat","weight":"700","capitalization":"uppercase","color":"#141630","size":"36px","lineHeight":"1.3em"}}}}}},"innerContent":{"desktop":{"value":"<p>Punta Cana moments</p><h2>See the island beyond the ride</h2>"}}},"builderVersion":"5.11.1"} /-->
